From 100602faad7051171fe427ee3632fbeadd9f46ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 04:47:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Spike: record nothing the rates do not read

Found by a liveness pass over one rate evaluation's tape. A height above a
crown reads passive zeros rather than zeros scaled by active factors; the
height scan copies only the tallest height; and the field without the boundary
interval, read only by the boundary nodes, is built only up to their height.
Forward values and the gradient are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFsPxk1yy62LrcCbtZUVeB
